  "notes": "USAGE:\n{増額|ぞうがく} refers specifically to increases in monetary amounts. It is distinct from {増加|ぞうか} (general increase in quantity) and {値上|ねあ}げ (price hike for consumers). {増額|ぞうがく} is used for budgets, salaries, investments, and other financial figures.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {予算|よさん}の{増額|ぞうがく}: budget increase\n- {給与|きゅうよ}の{増額|ぞうがく}: salary increase\n- {大幅|おおはば}な{増額|ぞうがく}: significant increase\n- {増額|ぞうがく}を{要求|ようきゅう}する: to demand an increase",
